              "text": "The proposed award of this contract follows a mini competition undertaken through the Housing Related Support Framework. This commission has been developed in response to unmet need identified through the Council's Domestic Abuse Needs Assessment and Domestic Abuse Strategy, with particular attention to victims and survivors whose experience of domestic abuse is compounded by complex or intersecting support needs. The award of this contract will provide specialist safe accommodation and support for victims and survivors with intersecting needs. A Key Decision is required because the maximum potential contract value exceeds \u00a3500,000 and the service is expected to have a significant impact on communities living and/or working across two or more wards within Manchester.",
