              "start_row_offset_idx": 0,
              "end_row_offset_idx": 1,
              "start_col_offset_idx": 1,
              "end_col_offset_idx": 2,
              "text": "Insourcing was considered but rejected due to the specialist nature of the service, which requires expertise in delivering domestic abuse-informed support alongside accommodation for individuals and families with multiple and often complex support needs. The council would not be able to satisfactorily deliver the requirements needed. External delivery by a specialist provider was considered the most appropriate delivery model.",
